\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces Feature overlap ablation (GB). In-Dom.\ = SWE-Agent in-domain macro-F1; Cross-Ag.\ = SWE-Agent $\to $ OpenHands zero-shot. Top: on all OH windows, LF-overlap features alone exceed the full model cross-coding-agent ($+$1.0\,pp; on conf${\geq }$2, direction reverses by $-$0.71\,pp); residual features collapse. Bottom: removing each LF-group individually; cmd\_rep features account for the largest transfer drop ($-$40.6\,pp).}}{17}{table.caption.49}\protected@file@percent }
