\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces Cycle detector vs.\ structural features. In-domain: SWE-Agent test set (silver = conf${\geq }$2 silver labels; gold = Set~B gold labels). Cross-agent: SWE-Agent $\to $ OpenHands zero-shot. Cycle detectors match structural GB on gold in-domain (${\sim }$0.84) but collapse on cross-agent transfer ($-$43.7\,pp gap), confirming that cross-agent generalization---not in-domain detection---is the genuine structural contribution.}}{17}{table.caption.50}\protected@file@percent }
